				<title>SCP-5429</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5429</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5429&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Safe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5429 is to be kept in a standard anomalous item containment locker at Site ██.&lt;br /&gt;
All personal wishing to use SCP-5429 for personal application may do so after psycological evaluation and approoval by Dr.██████.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recovery:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5429 was discoverd in an abandoned building located at &lt;tt&gt;██,█████° lat | █,█████° lon&lt;/tt&gt; by MTF Epsilon-6 (&amp;quot;Village Idiots&amp;quot;) operatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5429 is a glass sphere, roughly 5cm in diameter. When in it&#039;s inactive state, SCP-5429 emmits a slight white glow.&lt;br /&gt;
SCP-5429 enters it&#039;s active state when picked up by a person, dissatisfied with their current gender. Upon activation, SCP-5429 glows in the stereotypical color of the diesired gender. About 2 seconds later, SCP-5429 starts a transformation process to the desired gender, taking 5 to 10 seconds on average. The subject experiences no pain while transforming, although strong confusion is common upon subjects. While in the process of transforming, no known method can part SCP-5429 and the subject. When the procces is over, SCP-5429 will produce a 0,5cm x 4cm note with the message &amp;quot;Are you happy now?&amp;quot;. Completely transformed subjects are a 100% match to their desired gender.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;blockquote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing Logs:&lt;/strong&gt;*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject: D-26436&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject Info: Male, no adversion to current gender.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Effect: SCP-5429 glows slightly brighter.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject: D-16893&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject Info: Female, no adversion to current gender.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Effect: SCP-5429 glows slightly brighter.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject: D-38266&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject Info: Male, expressd desire to become Female&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Effect: SCP-5429 starts glowing pale pink. D-38266 expiriences typical effects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject: D-25235&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject Info:Female, expressd desire to become Male&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Effect: SCP-5429 starts glowing pale blue. D-25235 expiriences typical effects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject: D-14321&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject Info: No Gender due to a birth defect, dissatisfied with birth defect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Effect: SCP-5429 erraticly flickers for a few seconds until stopping on blue. D-14321 expiriences typical effects.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Subject: ████████&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Subject Info: Non human, sentient SCP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Effect: [SECURITY CLEARANCE 4 NEEDED]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#171; &lt;a class=&quot;newpage&quot; href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5428&quot;&gt;SCP-5428&lt;/a&gt; | SCP-5429 | &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5430&quot;&gt;SCP-5430&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#187;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/myoldnamewasbad&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6581091&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607523812&quot; alt=&quot;myoldnamewasbad&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6581091)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/myoldnamewasbad&quot;  &gt;myoldnamewasbad&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
