essd desire to become Female</strong><br /> <strong>Effect: SCP-5429 starts glowing pale pink. D-38266 expiriences typical effects.</strong></p> <p><strong>Subject: D-25235</strong><br /> <strong>Subject Info:Female, expressd desire to become Male</strong><br /> <strong>Effect: SCP-5429 starts glowing pale blue. D-25235 expiriences typical effects.</strong></p> <p><strong>Subject: D-14321</strong><br /> <strong>Subject Info: No Gender due to a birth defect, dissatisfied with birth defect</strong><br /> <strong>Effect: SCP-5429 erraticly flickers for a few seconds until stopping on blue. D-14321 expiriences typical effects.</strong></p> <p><strong>Subject: ████████</strong><br /> <strong>Subject Info: Non human, sentient SCP</strong><br /> <strong>Effect: [SECURITY CLEARANCE 4 NEEDED]</strong></p> </div> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5428">SCP-5428</a> | SCP-5429 | <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5430">SCP-5430</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/myoldnamewasbad" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6581091&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607523812" alt="myoldnamewasbad" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6581091)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/myoldnamewasbad" >myoldnamewasbad</a></span></p> 
