					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="creditRate"> <div class="rateBox"> <div class="rate-box-with-credit-button"> <div class="creditButton"> <p><a class="fa fa-info" href="#u-credit-view"></a></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"></div> <div id="u-credit-view"> <div class="fader"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-jp-sandbox3.wdfiles.com/local--code/credit%3Abackmodule/1" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="" style=""></iframe></p> </div> <div class="modalcontainer"> <div class="modalbox"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h2><span>Info</span></h2> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit first"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/3" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="" width="" class="close-credits" style="height:2em;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/ellie3-gimmick-free">More by this author</a></strong></p> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="credit-back" style="text-align: center;"> <p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--code/info%3Astyle/2" align="" frameborder="" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="height:2em;width: 100%;margin: 0;padding: 0;border: 0;background: transparent;"></iframe></p> </div> <div class="creditBottomRate" style="position:relative;height:30px;"> <div style="text-align: center; top: 0px;"></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-6666-j/doughnut.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="doughnut.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>Image taken from Junior Researcher Pene Ladro's social media that is presumed to have contained SCP-6666-J</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-6666-J</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Euclid</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-6666-J is contained in a standard humanoid containment cell. In order to combat its anomalous capabilities, it is fed a diet consisting of holy water and fruit grown with exclusively holy water<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-300622-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>.</p> <p>During mealtimes, SCP-6666-J must be closely monitored to ensure it does not bite a fruit in a way that produces a phallic shape.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-6666-J is a demon currently possessing the body of Junior Researcher Pene Ladro. When SCP-6666-J is exposed to non-holy food, it is capable of taking the form of a more phallic-shaped version of said food which, when consumed by a victim<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-300622-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup>, allows SCP-6666-J to possess the consumer's body.</p> <p>When inside of an SCP-6666-J-1 instance, SCP-6666-J is able to manifest different powers, such as teleportation, telepathy, flight, and most notably the ability to leave the body of SCP-6666-J-1, through the means of consuming phallic-shaped foods.</p> <p>Past SCP-6666-J-1 instances, which have been found to be primarily male-identifying, do not have any memory of their possession aside from a deep voice exclaiming the words &quot;it's snatchin' time!&quot; at which they recognize they no longer have a phallus.</p> <p><strong>Addendum:</strong></p> <div class="report-box"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>INCIDENT SCP-6666-J-1</span></h3> </div> <hr /> <p>Incident SCP-6666-J-1 occurred when Dr. Noah Addams attempted to interview SCP-6666-J. The interview has been transcripted below.</p> <div class="quote-block"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong>&lt;Begin Log&gt;</strong></p> </div> <p><strong>Dr. Noah Addams:</strong> Hello, SCP-6666-J.</p> <p><em>The audio of the log appears to cut out for a few seconds.</em></p> <p><strong>Dr. Noah Addams:</strong> Ow!</p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong>&lt;End Log&gt;</strong></p> </div> </div> <br /> Following the incident, no further interviews with SCP-6666-J are to be conducted.<br /> <br /> <br /></div> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-300622-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. Excluding bananas</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-300622-2"><a href="javascript:;" >2</a>. Hereby referred to as SCP-6666-J-1</div> </div> <div class="licensebox22"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;Hide&nbsp;Licensing&nbsp;/&nbsp;Citation</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Cite this page as:</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-guide">Licensing Guide</a>.<br /> <strong>Licensing Disclosures</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>Filename:</strong> doughnut.jpg<br /> <strong>Name:</strong> Cock and balls doughnut.jpg<br /> <strong>Author:</strong> jill, jellidonut&#8230; whatever<br /> <strong>License:</strong> CC BY-SA 2.0<br /> <strong>Source Link:</strong> <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cock_and_balls_doughnut.jpg">Wikimedia Commons</a></p> </blockquote> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <p>For more information about on-wiki content, visit the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/licensing-master-list">Licensing Master List</a>.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ellie3" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3656445&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607523812" alt="Ellie3" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3656445)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ellie3" >Ellie3</a></span></p> 
